      "text": "Creekside Court subdivision at 320 Church Street (parent APNs 056-150-010 and 056-150-120): 12 residential lots, an open space conservation area, a passive recreation park and a private street on about 5.5 acres. A 2012 initial study/MND covered an earlier version; an addendum covered the reduced version approved in November 2017.",
